cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoBrain in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "GeoBrain: An End-to-End Differentiable Platform for Integrated Subsurface Modeling"
abstract: >-
  GeoBrain is an open, modular platform for Geoscientific Bayesian Reasoning
  with Artificial Intelligence. It combines differentiable physics, Bayesian
  inference and deep learning so that a whole subsurface workflow, from a
  geostatistical earth model through rock physics to a geophysical forward
  model and back out as an inversion, is one computational graph. Every
  forward model is a composable operator, every operator declares how it
  differentiates, and the same problem object serves a deterministic
  optimiser and a posterior sampler alike.
type: software
